
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. تسجيل مستخدم جديد
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Mohammad",
  "lastname": "Alrahhal",
  "email": "mohammad.test@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

###

### 2. تسجيل الدخول
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mohammad.test@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}

###

### 3. اختبار كلمة مرور خاطئة - المتوقع 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mohammad.test@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPass123"
}

###

### 4. اختبار التسجيل بالبريد نفسه - المتوقع 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Mohammad",
  "lastname": "Alrahhal",
  "email": "mohammad.test@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123"
}
